[
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（ふう、必要なものはこれで全部かな\r\nん？　あれは……）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "bg": "00027",
    "bgm": "029"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006004110010,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "プロデューサー……！？\r\n今日は事務所にいるはずじゃ……",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "charCategory": "stand_fix",
    "charType": "characters",
    "charId": "006",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/200600411/2006004110010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ちょっと、買い出しに来てたんだ\r\n咲耶も買い物か？　でもここ……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger_s",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "se": "0186",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1200
  },
  {
    "id": 2006004110020,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "……ああ、少し見たいものがあってね\r\nフフ、オフの日にまでアナタに会えるなんて……",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600411/2006004110020"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006004110030,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "なんだか、運命めいたものを感じてしまうね\r\n私の喜びを、アナタも感じてくれていると嬉しいな",
    "charAnim1": "wait5",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600411/2006004110030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "運命だなんて、咲耶は相変わらずだな\r\nで、その紙袋が目当ての買い物か？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006004110040,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "……ああ、そうなんだ。色々見ていたんだが、\r\nやっと納得できるものが見つかってね",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600411/2006004110040"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006004110050,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "そうだ……今から時間をもらえないかな？\r\nどこか、ふたりになれる場所で……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600411/2006004110050"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "effectLabel": "black",
    "effectTarget": {
      "type": "rect",
      "width": 1136,
      "height": 640,
      "color": "000000"
    },
    "effectValue": {
      "type": "from",
      "x": 1000,
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 1000
    },
    "waitType": "effect"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "sakuya"
  },
  {
    "bg": "00002",
    "effectLabel": "black",
    "effectValue": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 1000,
      "easing": "easeInQuart"
    },
    "waitType": "effect"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "こんなところでよかったのか？\r\nせっかくのオフの日に事務所なんて",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006004110060,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "ああ。もともと、買い物の後にくるつもりだったんだ\r\n……これを渡すためにね",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600411/2006004110060"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "se": "0177",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1500
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "これ、さっき咲耶が買ってたやつじゃないか\r\nこれ、俺に……？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006004110070,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "アナタへのプレゼントだ\r\n受け取ってほしい",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600411/2006004110070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あ……ありがとう、咲耶！\r\n今開けても大丈夫か？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006004110080,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "もちろんさ\r\n気に入ってくれるといいのだけれど……",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600411/2006004110080"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "se": "0177",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1000
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "お……名刺入れか！\r\n咲耶らしいシックなデザインだな",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ありがとう、大事に使わせてもらうよ",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1000
  },
  {
    "id": 2006004110090,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "………………",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600411/2006004110090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……咲耶？　どうしたんだ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006004110100,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "いや、別に？\r\nアナタが喜んでくれて良かった、と思っただけさ",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600411/2006004110100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いや、絶対それだけじゃないだろ\r\n何かあったのか……？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006004110110,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "……本当は、色々と考えていたんだ\r\nアナタに驚いてもらえるような渡し方を",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600411/2006004110110"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006004110120,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "フフ、誰かさんのおかげで、その思い悩んでいた時間は\r\nパアになってしまったけれどね",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600411/2006004110120"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006004110130,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "そのことに私は拗ねているだけだよ",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600411/2006004110130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そ、それは……なんというか、すまん……\r\nで、でも、どんな渡し方でも嬉しいものは嬉しいぞ！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "名刺入れなんて、咲耶らしい良いチョイスだよな！\r\n毎日のように使うし、いつも持ち歩くものだし……",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006004110140,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "いつもアナタの傍にある……そんなものを渡したかったんだ\r\nけれど、それよりも……",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600411/2006004110140"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006004110150,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "……ねえ、プロデューサー\r\n私をスカウトした日のことを、覚えているかい？",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600411/2006004110150"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "え？\r\n……あ、ああ。もちろん覚えてるけど……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006004110160,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "あの日アナタにもらった名刺で、\r\n私はアイドルへの一歩を踏み出した。世界が、変わった",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600411/2006004110160"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006004110170,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "そして、アナタが名刺を渡して人と繋がることで、\r\n私はアイドルとして、更に広い世界へと歩みだすことができる",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600411/2006004110170"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006004110180,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "だから名刺とは、私にとってまさに宝物\r\nそれを入れる名刺入れは、宝箱に等しいものなんだ",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600411/2006004110180"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006004110190,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "だから……アナタの名刺入れが少しくたびれてるのを見て、\r\nそろそろ買い替えないとと独り言ちているのを聞いて……",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600411/2006004110190"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006004110200,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "チャンスだと思ったんだ\r\nアナタにプレゼントする、ね",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600411/2006004110200"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "まさか、そこまで見られてたとは……\r\nでも、名刺入れが宝箱なんて、咲耶らしい表現だなぁ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006004110210,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "そうかい？　世の中には、開けてみないとわからない\r\n宝箱がいっぱいあると思うんだ",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600411/2006004110210"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006004110220,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "人もそうだ。話して、触れて、そうしてやっと\r\nその人という中身がわかる……ほら、宝箱みたいだろう？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600411/2006004110220"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006004110230,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "……ねえプロデューサー\r\nアナタの中には、どんな素敵な宝物が眠っているんだろうね",
    "charAnim1": "wait5",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600411/2006004110230"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "お、俺の中にか……？\r\nそんな大したものは入ってないと思うぞ……？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006004110240,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "フフ、私を『W.I.N.G.』優勝まで導いたプロデューサーが\r\nそんなつまらない謙遜をしないでくれ。……だから",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600411/2006004110240"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "y": 50,
      "scale": 1.1,
      "time": 400
    },
    "se": "0220",
    "effectLabel": "black2",
    "effectTarget": {
      "type": "rect",
      "width": 1136,
      "height": 640,
      "color": "000000"
    },
    "effectValue": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 1000,
      "easing": "easeOutQuart"
    },
    "waitType": "effect"
  },
  {
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "bg": "00000",
    "effectLabel": "black2",
    "effectValue": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 1000,
      "easing": "easeInQuart"
    },
    "waitType": "effect"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006004110250,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "ねえ、アナタの中に眠るものを……\r\n全て、私に見せてくれないかい……？",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "y": -50,
      "scale": 1,
      "time": 400
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/200600411/2006004110250"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "お、おい……！？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006004110260,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "……なんてね、冗談だよ",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "bg": "00002",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600411/2006004110260"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "さ、咲耶……\r\n咲耶の冗談は心臓によくないな……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006004110270,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "フフ、私の楽しみを奪ったのだから\r\nこれくらいのお返しはさせてもらわないと",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600411/2006004110270"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006004110280,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "プレゼントを渡すのを、本当に楽しみにしていたんだ\r\nどうすれば驚いてもらえるか、より喜んでもらえるかって",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600411/2006004110280"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あ、あの時咲耶を見つけたのは不可抗力であって……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それに、どんな渡され方だったとしても、\r\n俺の嬉しさに変わりはないんだからな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006004110290,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "クス、わかってるよ\r\n子供っぽい八つ当たりだ。ごめんね、プロデューサー",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600411/2006004110290"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006004110300,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "そうだね……\r\nでは今のお詫びに、いつか私の中身も教えてあげるよ",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600411/2006004110300"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006004110310,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "アナタにならば、私の中に眠るものを…………\r\n……見せられる気がするんだ",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600411/2006004110310"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006004110320,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "……ね？　プロデューサー",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200600411/2006004110320"
  },
  {
